# Finding (pod-audit, constraint resolve:seeAlso): storage-description rdfs:seeAlso
# lists </vault/wiki/pages/> and </vault/wiki/sources/>, both 404.

<urn:uuid:15adc751-95c9-456c-ae90-86ebc172ce0f>
    a as:Announce, mem:RealignAction, prov:Activity ;
    as:actor <urn:agent:claude-code> ;
    as:target </vault/wiki/working/curator-proposals/> ;
    as:object </vault/.well-known/solid> ;
    prov:wasAssociatedWith <urn:agent:claude-code> ;
    prov:used </vault/wiki/> , </vault/settings/publicTypeIndex> ;
    prov:wasDerivedFrom </vault/.well-known/solid> ;
    mem:stalenessClass mem:DanglingReference ;
    mem:rationale """The storage description's rdfs:seeAlso names </vault/wiki/pages/> and </vault/wiki/sources/>; both 404. The live wiki/ container listing (ground truth, deployed-Pod precedence) holds concepts/, people/, places/, events/, organizations/, procedures/, working/ — no pages/ or sources/. The Type Index confirms the merge: both skos:Concept (#reg0) and wiki:Source (#reg1) route to wiki/concepts/, i.e. 'pages' was renamed to 'concepts' and 'sources' were merged into 'concepts'. Repair: drop the two dead seeAlso terms and add the four live containers the list currently omits (concepts/, places/, events/, organizations/). The overlay storage-patch.ttl was already corrected (lists concepts/); the deployed staleness lives in the static, non-PATCHable css/config/void-description.json — so this is a REPO edit, not an N3 Patch.""" ;
    as:published "2026-05-24T11:47:34Z"^^xsd:dateTime .

